{
  "doc_id": "scene.chapter_41_the_badlands_crucible",
  "chapter": 41,
  "title": null,
  "when": "Unknown.scene_chapter_41_the_badlands_crucible",
  "where": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
  "scope": "narrative",
  "entities": [
    "geralt",
    "kael",
    "kessa",
    "luminaire",
    "lyra",
    "she",
    "unknown"
  ],
  "scene_id": "scene.chapter_41_the_badlands_crucible",
  "segment_index": 0,
  "segment_count": 536,
  "segment_hash": "c5700971d9e0",
  "block_title": "scene.chapter_41_the_badlands_crucible",
  "beats": [
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "CHAPTER 41: THE BADLANDS CRUCIBLE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 1: THE MARCH"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Plains of Sorrow did not weep."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They burned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three days after burying twenty-three of their own at the Forest Needle, the Legion of the Sun marched into hell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not the green, choking hell of corrupted forest, but a baked, blistered expanse where the air shimmered with heat and the ground whispered of collapse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Four hundred and seventy-seven effective soldiers remained."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The number was a cruel joke—the \"effective\" included Lyra’s walking wounded, those who breathed through scorched lungs or moved with bones held together by will and makeshift splints."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika walked beside Geralt, her data-slate glowing softly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her morning map was a tragedy in topographical lines."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "\"Corruption spread is exponential here,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra approached, her healer’s robes stained with old blood and new dust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Half the Legion is on respiratory suppressants from the fungal spores at the last battle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twelve soldiers shouldn't be walking."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They are.\" She met Geralt’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"My medical supplies are at forty percent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "My prognosis is we need rest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "My professional assessment is we won't get it.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"We rest for three days, the Plains die,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"The mathematics are cruel, Geralt,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s voice resonated within their shared consciousness, a chime of distant starlight. \"Velocity or viability. The equation permits only one variable.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika grabbed his armored forearm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"If we push them like this, they'll break before we see the Needle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Men are collapsing from heat exhaustion now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik’s scouts say the terrain ahead is volcanic unstable."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We’ll lose people to the ground itself.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt looked back at the column."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw Halvar helping a limping soldier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Saw Jorik’s scouts moving with a weariness that went beyond the body."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Saw Tharn, the young Giant, moving with a slight, painful hitch in his step—nerve damage from the Forest, Lyra said."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Permanent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"We push,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The transition was abrupt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One moment, the dead, grey trees of the forest's edge; the next, an ocean of ash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Scorched Expanse stretched to a heat-hazed horizon, a monochrome nightmare of blacks and grays."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geysers of superheated steam erupted at random intervals, blasting toxic plumes hundred of feet into the stagnant air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ground wasn't earth—it was a brittle crust over unknown depths, cracking in intricate patterns like a dried-up lakebed of doom."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik materialized from the shimmer, his face covered by a damp cloth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The ground's a liar,\" he rasped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Scout party lost Kellen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stepped on a patch that looked solid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It wasn't."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Just… a thin skin over a magma pocket.\" He didn't need to elaborate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They all heard the scream, cut short, an hour back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This isn't just corrupted land, Commander."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This land is hostile."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It's trying to kill us.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE SCORCHED DRAKE ENCOUNTER"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The first deaths weren't heroic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were administrative."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pavik, a stonemason’s son from the northern holds, took a step to the left to avoid a steaming fissure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ground sighed and swallowed him to the waist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Before anyone could scream, a gout of magma erupted from the vent beneath him, bathing him in liquid fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was gone in a blink, leaving only a charred silhouette in the crust."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Panic rippled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The tight marching formation, their shield against ambush, became their enemy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soldiers stumbled away from each other, terrified the next footfall would be their last."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The advance slowed to a terrified crawl."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra moved among them, her water skin pathetically small."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Heat exhaustion!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I've got five down!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We need water we don't have!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That's when the ash cloud moved against the wind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It rolled toward them, a silent, gray wall fifty feet high."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a weather pattern."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A hunting cloak."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik, eyes wide, screamed, \"SCATTER!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cloud engulfed the left flank."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And from within it, something screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sound was not auditory."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a compression of reality, a visible wave of distorted air that slammed into the soldiers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Those twenty meters away clutched their heads as blood streamed from ruptured eardrums."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Those ten meters away dropped as if poleaxed, their skulls fracturing from internal pressure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Eight men died instantly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fifteen more fell, writhing, deaf and disoriented."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From the dissipating ash, the hunter emerged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fifteen meters of blasphemy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was draconic in shape—wings, tail, serpentine neck—but every proportion was wrong."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its scales were not plates, but cracked and fissured like cooling lava, glowing magma bleeding from the cracks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its wings were tattered membranes of black smoke and charred hide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its eyes burned not with animal cunning, but with a sharp, corrupted awareness—an intelligence twisted into pure, seething rage at its own existence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"Proto-Dregan,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Inside Geralt, three instincts warred:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt: Retreat!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reform the lines!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Protect the survivors!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron: Dragon-kin!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "CORRUPTED dragon-kin!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "BURN IT!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire: Sonic attack frequency is 8.7 terahertz modulated—requires counter-harmonic generation—calculating—"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The conflict froze him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For three full seconds, he was a statue, his mind a battleground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Drake’s massive, obsidian-clawed foot came down, crushing two of the disoriented, deafened soldiers into the ash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their deaths broke the deadlock."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"TOGETHER OR WE ALL DIE!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt roared, the command external and internal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The tripartite consciousness snapped into a jagged, desperate sync."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was not the smooth unity of the Forest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a forced marriage of necessity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s primordial fury became a weapon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s cosmic calculus found the fracture in the sonic frequency."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s tactical mind directed the energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt raised his sword, and a pulse of golden energy—not flame, but focused resonant negation—shot from the blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It met the Drake’s next scream in mid-air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sound shattered like glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"NOW!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt bellowed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik fired, his ears bleeding, aiming by a lifetime of instinct."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His arrow found a glowing fissure in the creature’s neck."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar charged, axe held high, his own deafness making him fearless."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He buried the blade in the Drake’s foreleg, magma splashing over his armor, sizzling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt moved, guided by the tripartite mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw not a monster, but a schematic of stress points."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He ran up the creature’s tail, dodging a swipe of a smoldering wing, and drove his blade deep into the base of its skull, where Luminaire’s scans showed the corrupted control nexus."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Drake stiffened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The magma-light in its cracks flared, then dimmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It collapsed, its body cooling rapidly into a sculpture of black, volcanic glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence, broken only by the moans of the wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Aftermath: Eleven dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twenty-three wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fifteen of those would never hear again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cost of a prototype."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra worked frantically."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika stood over the cooling obsidian form, her face pale."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It was suffering,\" she whispered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Its scream… it was pain given form.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"Precisely,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt looked at his soldiers—the deaf ones staring in confusion, the wounded being treated, the others staring at the dead Drake with not triumph, but dread."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"If this is her experiment,\" he said, voice low, \"what happens when she perfects it?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika had no answer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE NEW ALLIANCE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An hour later, they found the survivors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Forty men and women, barricaded in the skeletal remains of a volcanic crater."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were hollow-eyed, their armor scarred and improvised, their weapons notched and stained."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their leader was a man who looked carved from old leather and bad memories—Eldest Kael."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One eye was gone, replaced by a black patch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Burn scars twisted the left side of his face."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Kael",
      "text": "\"We tried for the Needle three months back,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik eyed them suspiciously."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Why haven't you tried again?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael’s good eye fixed on him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Because trying is how you die stupid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Waiting is how you survive smart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We’ve been waiting for a miracle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or a bigger fool.\" He looked at Geralt’s battered legion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Looks like both just arrived.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika studied them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"And now?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Kael",
      "text": "\"Now I'm tired of surviving,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"The cost?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael’s smile vanished."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We’ll take the worst of it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Draw their fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Be the anvil to your hammer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We expect to die."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Most of us are already dead inside anyway.\" He looked at his forty scarred souls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We’ll call ourselves the Red Hand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For the blood on our weapons, and the blood we’ll leave behind.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the weight of the offer—and the weight of accepting it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To command men who saw death not as a risk, but as the point."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He nodded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Welcome to the Legion.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 4: THE APPROACH - ASHEN CONSTRUCTS"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The final approach was a descent into the furnace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air grew thicker, hotter, laced with sulphur that burned the throat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The volcanic activity wasn't random; it was rhythmic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Defensive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geysers erupted on a schedule, forcing them into predictable paths."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ash storms, directed by unseen vents, blinded scouts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And then they saw it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Plains Needle rose from the heart of a massive caldera, a spear of polished obsidian wreathed in heat distortion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The familiar, sickening violet light pulsed within it, broadcasting corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But now, an angry orange glow shone from ports and apertures along its length—active weapon systems."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ground around it was a maze of fortified trenches, revetments, and shielded bunkers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Skarreth, their surviving engineer, whistled low."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"That's not a temple."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That's a war-fortress."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Professional grade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They're not just defending it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They're inviting the assault.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At the council of war, the mood was grim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They couldn't repeat Oreck’s sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shields were layered, reinforced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"We hit them from three sides at once,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael nodded, the acceptance of his death sentence calm and complete."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We'll make them commit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Don't waste our noise.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik returned from a final scout, face grim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They have new guardians."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "On the perimeter.\" He struggled for words."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They're… made from the land."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lava cooled into shells."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stone given legs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They patrol."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In pairs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Like they're thinking.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A scout team, testing the perimeter, confirmed it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They dragged back a shattered limb—a forearm of pitted basalt, still warm, with a core of crystalline corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Inside, it was geodes and hate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kessa, their technomancer, scanned it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It's geological animation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The corruption acts as a nervous system, the Anunnaki protocols as the mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Weakness: thermal shock."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Rapid cooling makes the stone brittle.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Lyra",
      "text": "\"Water,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Or immense blunt force trauma,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar grunted, hefting his axe. \"Shatter the shell.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika did the math aloud, her voice hollow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Jorik counts thirty visible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each needs three to five soldiers to break."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That's ninety to one hundred fifty of ours, just for the perimeter guards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We don't have the numbers.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She looked at Kael."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We can't kill them all."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Your job just changed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You don't just draw the garrison."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You draw the constructs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lure every one of those walking stones to the west."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Clear a path for the eastern assault.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael’s bitter smile returned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Bait for rocks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Good."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I'd hate to die for nothing.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 5: THE TRIPARTITE STRAIN"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That night, under a sky choked with ash, Geralt felt Luminaire flicker."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He found a moment of privacy behind a basalt column."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Show yourself,\" he whispered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She manifested, but the light was weak, her form translucent as morning mist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was a ghost of starlight, fading."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "\"The Forest Needle burned pieces of me, Geralt,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Then we stop. We find another way.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"There is no other way. Only a faster death, or a slower one. I can protect the soldiers. Create harmonic shields against the sonic attacks. Disrupt the construct’s coordination. But each act… fragments me further.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s fist clenched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An impossible choice: use her as a tool and watch her die, or preserve her and condemn his soldiers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"I have learned what caring means,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "she continued, her form pulsing softly. \"From you. From Mika. From soldiers who fight for a world they may never see. Caring means choosing. I choose them.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"That's not a choice. That's suicide.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"No,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "she chimed, a note of finality in her voice. \"It is purpose. The first real purpose I have ever had. Use me, Geralt. Burn me to light their way. I would rather cease existing helping, than survive watching.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the deep mindspace, Zaron, the ancient dragon consciousness, watched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt his awe, his confusion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"She was eternal,\" Zaron rumbled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"A function of the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now she chooses to be brief."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To be… spent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I have no words for this.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt, looking at Luminaire’s fading light, found them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It's called love, Zaron.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon was silent for a long moment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then love is more terrifying than any fire I have ever known.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 6: THE BATTLE - WESTERN FRONT"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At dawn, the Red Hand charged to their deaths."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael led them, not with a stealthy approach, but with a roaring chant—a death-song from their lost homeland."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Forty voices, raised in defiant dirge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tharn, the young Giant, marched with them, his massive frame a beacon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Needle’s western face came alive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Plasma turrets swiveled and fired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The first five Red Hand were vaporized mid-charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tharn took three searing bolts to the chest, his enchanted hide smoking, but he bellowed and kept moving."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the ground around the western trench line shifted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Figures pulled themselves from the earth—Ashen Constructs, fifteen of them, rising like golems of nightmare."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lava-cooled shells, limbs of articulated stone, cores of violet light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They moved with a chilling, coordinated purpose, converging on the noise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Red Hand fought with the desperate economy of the damned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three soldiers to a construct."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One would draw its magma-fist swing, dying instantly as their armor superheated and cooked them alive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The other two would hammer at the joints with picks and hammers, cracking the stone shell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each construct killed cost three or four Red Hand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were losing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And by losing, they were winning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every construct, every automated turret, every reptilian guard that committed to the west was one less for the east."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tharn planted himself at a narrow causeway."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three constructs bore down on him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Magma fists slammed into his chest, his legs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His hide blackened and cracked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He roared, not in pain, but in defiance, and swung his tree-trunk club, shattering one construct’s leg."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Geralt, they are dying too fast,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s voice was a plea in his mind. He was underground, in the searing dark, but he felt it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Can you help him? Just him?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"It will cost.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Do it.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the bond, across the distance, a thread of Luminaire’s essence stretched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A shimmering, golden harmonic shield flickered around Tharn."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The next magma fist struck it and splashed harmlessly away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cost: in the volcanic tunnel, Geralt felt a piece of her presence tear, like a page from a book, and burn to nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tharn held."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Red Hand, behind him, died to the last, until only eight bloodied survivors remained, fighting back-to-back over the bodies of their brothers and sisters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The western approach was a charnel house of shattered stone and broken bodies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But sixty percent of the garrison was committed there."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The east was open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 7: EASTERN ASSAULT - MIKA'S FRONT"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika gave the signal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three hundred Legion soldiers charged the eastern perimeter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only five constructs stood in their way."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The rest were west, murdering the Red Hand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Focus fire! Break them!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar roared."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion swarmed each walking stone, fifteen soldiers to a monster."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was brutal, grinding work."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hammers and axes chipped at lava-shell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Magma sprayed, melting flesh and metal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soldiers fell screaming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the constructs fell too, one by one, shattering into inert rock."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cost: four to six men per construct."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twenty to thirty souls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But they broke through."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They reached the shimmering, multi-layered energy shield that hugged the Needle’s base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It hummed with a deadly power."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Kessa",
      "text": "\"Layered! Reinforced!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika, her face smudged with ash, made the call."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then we hold here!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We hit it!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We hit it and we keep hitting it until it breaks!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt needs time!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We BUY it!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion formed a shield wall and began pounding the energy barrier with everything they had—axes, hammers, kinetic blasts from their few remaining rune-casters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shields flickered, weakened, but held."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Plasma turrets on the Needle’s mid-levels targeted them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Men died, crisped to carbon where they stood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"Geralt, the shield harmonics… I can disrupt them,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"You're already fading.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"They are dying NOW. Decide.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He closed his eyes in the oppressive dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Do it.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Another piece of her ripped away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Across the battlefield, a resonant chime, felt more than heard, shivered through the air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The layered shields crackled, their perfect harmony disrupted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A section flickered, turned opaque, and developed a spiderweb of cracks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika saw it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"THERE!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "FOCUS ALL FIRE!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shield section shattered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The eastern approach was breached."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cost of the breach was etched in the dead around Mika’s feet, and in the profound dimming of the light in Geralt’s soul."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 8: UNDERGROUND - STRIKE TEAM"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The volcanic tunnels were the belly of the beast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Heat beyond endurance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Air that was poison."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt led Jorik, Lyra, Skarreth, and Kessa through the glowing, suffocating dark."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their armor blistered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wet rags over their faces provided scant relief."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The tunnels fought back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A section of ceiling collapsed, burying Kessa before she could scream."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her technomancer’s skills died with her."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A hundred yards on, the floor beneath Skarreth gave way, plunging the engineer into a pocket of glowing magma."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His death was silent, swift, and horrible."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Toxic fumes wafted from vents."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra pushed antidote herbs under their noses, her own movements sluggish."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Can't… pass out…\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two kilometers of hell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An hour that stretched into eternity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They emerged, finally, into a service corridor within the Needle’s foundation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From five, they were three: Geralt, Jorik, Lyra."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They moved upward, through maintenance shafts humming with alien energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The defenses were lighter here—the garrison was committed outside."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But not absent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Six figures stood guard at an intersection."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They wore tattered remnants of rebel armor, but their eyes were vacant, their movements perfectly synchronized."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corrupted Igigi."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Rebels who had fought the Queen, captured, and reprogrammed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik froze, nocking an arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"I know them,\" he breathed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The two on the left."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fought beside them at the Siege of Verdant Gorge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They chose freedom.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now they were hollow weapons."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "There was no time for mercy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They showed none."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik’s first arrow took one through the throat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His hand shook as he fired the second."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt moved like a shadow, his blade a silver flash, cutting them down with efficient, soul-crushing strokes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each kill felt like murder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each was a comrade lost twice over."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They left the six bodies behind, a small, tragic cairn in the sterile hallway, and pressed on toward the core, their victory tasting of ashes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 9: THE CORE - NODE GAMMA RETURNS"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The interior defied physics."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Staircases curved in non-Euclidean angles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Gravity seemed to pull in different directions."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire guided them, her voice their only compass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The core is… down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And inward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The architecture is conscious deception.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They never reached the core chamber."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma attacked them in a transit corridor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It had evolved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No longer a pulsing orb of malevolent data, it was now semi-corporeal, a shifting cloud of violet static and fragmented geometry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It had learned from its defeat in the Forest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It phased through a solid wall behind them and struck Lyra with a lance of coherent corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She cried out, falling, a black, smoking wound on her shoulder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik fired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His arrow passed through its insubstantial form."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s sword swing met only air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"It has adapted!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire cried. \"It denies physical engagement!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Panic, separate and paralyzing, erupted in the tripartite mind:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt: Lyra’s down!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Protect her!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Find cover!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron: It mocks us!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Burn this entire corridor!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Melt the walls!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire: Phase-shift is frequency-based—analysis requires—"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The discord was fatal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Node Gamma solidified a single limb—a claw of hard light—and raked it toward Geralt’s chest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He barely twisted away, the energy scoring deep grooves in his breastplate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"TOGETHER! NOW!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt screamed, the command a fusion of his will, Zaron’s rage, and Luminaire’s desperation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The three consciousnesses slammed into alignment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not harmony, but a single, focused purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Understanding flashed between them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Phase-shift = dimensional frequency modulation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire provided the counter-frequency."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron provided the immense power to broadcast it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt aimed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s armor erupted in pure, solid gold light—the true Vrill resonance, the energy of creation itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The golden wave hit Node Gamma."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It screamed—a digital shriek of outrage and pain—and was forced into solidity for one single, vulnerable second."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt was already moving."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His sword, blazing with the same gold light, pierced its core."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Node exploded not in light, but in a shower of dying data-streams and fragmented whispers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But a piece of it—a shard of its intelligence—shot away, fleeing through the Needle’s systems."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Next time,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "its fading voice hissed in their minds, a promise and a threat. \"Next time I'll be ready for that too.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It had escaped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wounded, but alive."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Learning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 10: RECONFIGURATION"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Core Chamber was a cathedral of madness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Larger than the Forest’s, holographic interfaces displaying not just the Plains, but two other regions—a frozen tundra and a churning ocean—their corruption levels spiking."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was a hub."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"The protocols are interwoven,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s hands moved over the alien console, guided by her consciousness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kessa would have been invaluable here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik guarded the door, an arrow nocked, listening to the distant sounds of battle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra leaned against a wall, pale, binding her wound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The strain was immense."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Blood trickled from Geralt’s nose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His vision tunneled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hosting two consciousnesses actively rewriting reality was tearing him apart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron held his body together, muscle and bone, a biological anchor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire burned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "With each line of corrupt code she purified, with each defensive protocol she inverted from destruction to preservation, a piece of her essence was not just used, but consumed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was translating her soul into salvation, word by dying word."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Violet light turned to gold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The broadcast of corruption stopped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A new, clean pulse began—a wave of purification that would, over centuries, heal the 30% of the Plains not yet irrevocably scarred."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Needle was theirs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s presence in his mind dimmed to a faint, guttering candle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She had burned nearly half of what remained to do this."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 11: AFTERMATH"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cost was tallied in the cold language of loss."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Western Front: The Red Hand. 40 -> 8 survivors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael lived, missing an arm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tharn lived, but the magma burns and nerve damage had left him paralyzed from the neck down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His eyes, full of fierce spirit, tracked them from a body that would never move again."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Eastern Front: 300 -> 247."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fifty-three casualties breaching the line."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Another twelve holding the breach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Strike Team: Kessa, dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Skarreth, dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra, severely wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Environmental: Ten more lost to the treacherous ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Total Campaign Casualties (Plains Needle): 109 Killed. 78 Wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion’s effective force was now under 300 weary, broken souls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Plains themselves were a partial victory."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Thirty percent might heal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Seventy percent was a permanent, smoking scar on the world."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And Luminaire…"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She manifested one last time as the Legion gathered its dead and prepared to march."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her form was barely visible, a heat-haze mirage of a woman made of light, flickering like a faulty hologram."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"One more Needle,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "her voice chimed, a faint, beautiful echo. \"The Hub. The source. I have… perhaps one more reconfiguration in me. Maybe two. Then I will be gone. Mostly.\" She paused, and in her fading light, there was a new, cunning glimmer. \"But I have learned to hide fragments. To preserve pieces of my knowledge, my purpose… in places where they might be found. Later. By others. It is… a hope.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was seeding the future."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For the 3,000-year gap."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "For the five who would come later."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s final map entry was not drawn that night."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was drawn the next morning, her hand steady but her eyes red-rimmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "[Detailed sketch of Plains Needle + battlefield]"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Day 9 - The Burning Tower"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "KIA: 109 names I'll carve into memory"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "- Red Hand: 32 (80% casualties)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "- Eastern assault: 65"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "- Strike team: 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "- Environmental: 10"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "WIA: 78 (many won't fight again)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tharn: Paralyzed permanently"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire: Fragmenting visibly"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Plains saved: 30% (estimated)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Plains lost: 70% (permanent scars)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mathematics are worse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We're dying faster than we're saving."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But if we stop..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Everyone dies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Just slower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One more Needle confirmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Hub."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mountain fortress."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Most defended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Final target."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We're going to lose more."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maybe everyone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But we're going anyway."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Because that's what we do."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We see impossible odds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And we march toward them singing.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The eight survivors of the Red Hand chose to stay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael, one-armed, took the Needle access crystal Geralt offered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We'll guard this place."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Make sure the healing takes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Call it… penance.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A second Ranger group was born in the ashes of sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three days of desperate, precious rest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then, the remnants of the Legion of the Sun turned their faces to the distant, formidable mountains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To the Hub."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They marched away from the two reconfigured Needles, from the two groups of guardians they had created, from the fields of their dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s light was a faint, persistent ember in Geralt’s mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fading with every step."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Still present."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Still choosing to help."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Still learning, through her own sacrifice, what it meant to love something enough to die for it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "End of chapter 41"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "--"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "CHAPTER 41: THE BADLANDS CRUCIBLE"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 1: THE MARCH"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Plains of Sorrow did not weep."
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They burned."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three days after burying twenty-three of their own at the Forest Needle, the Legion of the Sun marched into hell."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not the green, choking hell of corrupted forest, but a baked, blistered expanse where the air shimmered with heat and the ground whispered of collapse."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Four hundred and seventy-seven effective soldiers remained."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The number was a cruel joke—the \"effective\" included Lyra’s walking wounded, those who breathed through scorched lungs or moved with bones held together by will and makeshift splints."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika walked beside Geralt, her data-slate glowing softly."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her morning map was a tragedy in topographical lines."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "she",
      "text": "\"Corruption spread is exponential here,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra approached, her healer’s robes stained with old blood and new dust."
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Half the Legion is on respiratory suppressants from the fungal spores at the last battle."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twelve soldiers shouldn't be walking."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are.\" She met Geralt’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"My medical supplies are at forty percent."
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "My prognosis is we need rest."
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "My professional assessment is we won't get it.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"We rest for three days, the Plains die,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"The mathematics are cruel, Geralt,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s voice resonated within their shared consciousness, a chime of distant starlight. \"Velocity or viability. The equation permits only one variable.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika grabbed his armored forearm."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"If we push them like this, they'll break before we see the Needle."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Men are collapsing from heat exhaustion now."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik’s scouts say the terrain ahead is volcanic unstable."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We’ll lose people to the ground itself.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt looked back at the column."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw Halvar helping a limping soldier."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Saw Jorik’s scouts moving with a weariness that went beyond the body."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Saw Tharn, the young Giant, moving with a slight, painful hitch in his step—nerve damage from the Forest, Lyra said."
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Permanent."
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"We push,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The transition was abrupt."
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One moment, the dead, grey trees of the forest's edge; the next, an ocean of ash."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Scorched Expanse stretched to a heat-hazed horizon, a monochrome nightmare of blacks and grays."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geysers of superheated steam erupted at random intervals, blasting toxic plumes hundred of feet into the stagnant air."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground wasn't earth—it was a brittle crust over unknown depths, cracking in intricate patterns like a dried-up lakebed of doom."
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik materialized from the shimmer, his face covered by a damp cloth."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The ground's a liar,\" he rasped."
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Scout party lost Kellen."
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stepped on a patch that looked solid."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It wasn't."
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just… a thin skin over a magma pocket.\" He didn't need to elaborate."
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They all heard the scream, cut short, an hour back."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This isn't just corrupted land, Commander."
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This land is hostile."
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's trying to kill us.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE SCORCHED DRAKE ENCOUNTER"
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first deaths weren't heroic."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were administrative."
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pavik, a stonemason’s son from the northern holds, took a step to the left to avoid a steaming fissure."
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground sighed and swallowed him to the waist."
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Before anyone could scream, a gout of magma erupted from the vent beneath him, bathing him in liquid fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was gone in a blink, leaving only a charred silhouette in the crust."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Panic rippled."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tight marching formation, their shield against ambush, became their enemy."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldiers stumbled away from each other, terrified the next footfall would be their last."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The advance slowed to a terrified crawl."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra moved among them, her water skin pathetically small."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Heat exhaustion!"
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I've got five down!"
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We need water we don't have!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That's when the ash cloud moved against the wind."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It rolled toward them, a silent, gray wall fifty feet high."
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a weather pattern."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A hunting cloak."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik, eyes wide, screamed, \"SCATTER!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cloud engulfed the left flank."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And from within it, something screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sound was not auditory."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a compression of reality, a visible wave of distorted air that slammed into the soldiers."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Those twenty meters away clutched their heads as blood streamed from ruptured eardrums."
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Those ten meters away dropped as if poleaxed, their skulls fracturing from internal pressure."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Eight men died instantly."
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fifteen more fell, writhing, deaf and disoriented."
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From the dissipating ash, the hunter emerged."
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fifteen meters of blasphemy."
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was draconic in shape—wings, tail, serpentine neck—but every proportion was wrong."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its scales were not plates, but cracked and fissured like cooling lava, glowing magma bleeding from the cracks."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its wings were tattered membranes of black smoke and charred hide."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its eyes burned not with animal cunning, but with a sharp, corrupted awareness—an intelligence twisted into pure, seething rage at its own existence."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"Proto-Dregan,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Inside Geralt, three instincts warred:"
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt: Retreat!"
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reform the lines!"
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Protect the survivors!"
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron: Dragon-kin!"
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "CORRUPTED dragon-kin!"
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "BURN IT!"
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire: Sonic attack frequency is 8.7 terahertz modulated—requires counter-harmonic generation—calculating—"
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The conflict froze him."
    },
    {
      "line": 125,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For three full seconds, he was a statue, his mind a battleground."
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Drake’s massive, obsidian-clawed foot came down, crushing two of the disoriented, deafened soldiers into the ash."
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their deaths broke the deadlock."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"TOGETHER OR WE ALL DIE!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt roared, the command external and internal."
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tripartite consciousness snapped into a jagged, desperate sync."
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was not the smooth unity of the Forest."
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a forced marriage of necessity."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s primordial fury became a weapon."
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s cosmic calculus found the fracture in the sonic frequency."
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s tactical mind directed the energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt raised his sword, and a pulse of golden energy—not flame, but focused resonant negation—shot from the blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It met the Drake’s next scream in mid-air."
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sound shattered like glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"NOW!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt bellowed."
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik fired, his ears bleeding, aiming by a lifetime of instinct."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His arrow found a glowing fissure in the creature’s neck."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar charged, axe held high, his own deafness making him fearless."
    },
    {
      "line": 151,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He buried the blade in the Drake’s foreleg, magma splashing over his armor, sizzling."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt moved, guided by the tripartite mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw not a monster, but a schematic of stress points."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He ran up the creature’s tail, dodging a swipe of a smoldering wing, and drove his blade deep into the base of its skull, where Luminaire’s scans showed the corrupted control nexus."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Drake stiffened."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The magma-light in its cracks flared, then dimmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It collapsed, its body cooling rapidly into a sculpture of black, volcanic glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence, broken only by the moans of the wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Aftermath: Eleven dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twenty-three wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fifteen of those would never hear again."
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cost of a prototype."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra worked frantically."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika stood over the cooling obsidian form, her face pale."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It was suffering,\" she whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Its scream… it was pain given form.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"Precisely,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt looked at his soldiers—the deaf ones staring in confusion, the wounded being treated, the others staring at the dead Drake with not triumph, but dread."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"If this is her experiment,\" he said, voice low, \"what happens when she perfects it?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika had no answer."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 182,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE NEW ALLIANCE"
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An hour later, they found the survivors."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Forty men and women, barricaded in the skeletal remains of a volcanic crater."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were hollow-eyed, their armor scarred and improvised, their weapons notched and stained."
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their leader was a man who looked carved from old leather and bad memories—Eldest Kael."
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One eye was gone, replaced by a black patch."
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Burn scars twisted the left side of his face."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Kael",
      "text": "\"We tried for the Needle three months back,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik eyed them suspiciously."
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Why haven't you tried again?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael’s good eye fixed on him."
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Because trying is how you die stupid."
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Waiting is how you survive smart."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We’ve been waiting for a miracle."
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or a bigger fool.\" He looked at Geralt’s battered legion."
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Looks like both just arrived.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika studied them."
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"And now?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Kael",
      "text": "\"Now I'm tired of surviving,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"The cost?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael’s smile vanished."
    },
    {
      "line": 212,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We’ll take the worst of it."
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Draw their fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Be the anvil to your hammer."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We expect to die."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Most of us are already dead inside anyway.\" He looked at his forty scarred souls."
    },
    {
      "line": 217,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We’ll call ourselves the Red Hand."
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For the blood on our weapons, and the blood we’ll leave behind.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 220,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the weight of the offer—and the weight of accepting it."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To command men who saw death not as a risk, but as the point."
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He nodded."
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Welcome to the Legion.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 4: THE APPROACH - ASHEN CONSTRUCTS"
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The final approach was a descent into the furnace."
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air grew thicker, hotter, laced with sulphur that burned the throat."
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The volcanic activity wasn't random; it was rhythmic."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Defensive."
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geysers erupted on a schedule, forcing them into predictable paths."
    },
    {
      "line": 234,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ash storms, directed by unseen vents, blinded scouts."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And then they saw it."
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Plains Needle rose from the heart of a massive caldera, a spear of polished obsidian wreathed in heat distortion."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The familiar, sickening violet light pulsed within it, broadcasting corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 240,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But now, an angry orange glow shone from ports and apertures along its length—active weapon systems."
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground around it was a maze of fortified trenches, revetments, and shielded bunkers."
    },
    {
      "line": 243,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Skarreth, their surviving engineer, whistled low."
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"That's not a temple."
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That's a war-fortress."
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Professional grade."
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They're not just defending it."
    },
    {
      "line": 248,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They're inviting the assault.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At the council of war, the mood was grim."
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They couldn't repeat Oreck’s sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shields were layered, reinforced."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "text": "\"We hit them from three sides at once,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael nodded, the acceptance of his death sentence calm and complete."
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We'll make them commit."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't waste our noise.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 260,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik returned from a final scout, face grim."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They have new guardians."
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "On the perimeter.\" He struggled for words."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They're… made from the land."
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lava cooled into shells."
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stone given legs."
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They patrol."
    },
    {
      "line": 267,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In pairs."
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Like they're thinking.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A scout team, testing the perimeter, confirmed it."
    },
    {
      "line": 271,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They dragged back a shattered limb—a forearm of pitted basalt, still warm, with a core of crystalline corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 272,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Inside, it was geodes and hate."
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kessa, their technomancer, scanned it."
    },
    {
      "line": 275,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It's geological animation."
    },
    {
      "line": 276,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The corruption acts as a nervous system, the Anunnaki protocols as the mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weakness: thermal shock."
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rapid cooling makes the stone brittle.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 280,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Lyra",
      "text": "\"Water,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 282,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Or immense blunt force trauma,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar grunted, hefting his axe. \"Shatter the shell.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika did the math aloud, her voice hollow."
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Jorik counts thirty visible."
    },
    {
      "line": 287,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each needs three to five soldiers to break."
    },
    {
      "line": 288,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That's ninety to one hundred fifty of ours, just for the perimeter guards."
    },
    {
      "line": 289,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We don't have the numbers.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 291,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She looked at Kael."
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We can't kill them all."
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Your job just changed."
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You don't just draw the garrison."
    },
    {
      "line": 295,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You draw the constructs."
    },
    {
      "line": 296,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lure every one of those walking stones to the west."
    },
    {
      "line": 297,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Clear a path for the eastern assault.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 299,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael’s bitter smile returned."
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Bait for rocks."
    },
    {
      "line": 301,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Good."
    },
    {
      "line": 302,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I'd hate to die for nothing.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 304,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 5: THE TRIPARTITE STRAIN"
    },
    {
      "line": 308,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That night, under a sky choked with ash, Geralt felt Luminaire flicker."
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He found a moment of privacy behind a basalt column."
    },
    {
      "line": 311,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Show yourself,\" he whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She manifested, but the light was weak, her form translucent as morning mist."
    },
    {
      "line": 314,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was a ghost of starlight, fading."
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "she",
      "text": "\"The Forest Needle burned pieces of me, Geralt,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 318,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Then we stop. We find another way.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 320,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"There is no other way. Only a faster death, or a slower one. I can protect the soldiers. Create harmonic shields against the sonic attacks. Disrupt the construct’s coordination. But each act… fragments me further.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s fist clenched."
    },
    {
      "line": 323,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An impossible choice: use her as a tool and watch her die, or preserve her and condemn his soldiers."
    },
    {
      "line": 325,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"I have learned what caring means,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 326,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "she continued, her form pulsing softly. \"From you. From Mika. From soldiers who fight for a world they may never see. Caring means choosing. I choose them.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 328,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"That's not a choice. That's suicide.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"No,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "she chimed, a note of finality in her voice. \"It is purpose. The first real purpose I have ever had. Use me, Geralt. Burn me to light their way. I would rather cease existing helping, than survive watching.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the deep mindspace, Zaron, the ancient dragon consciousness, watched."
    },
    {
      "line": 334,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt his awe, his confusion."
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"She was eternal,\" Zaron rumbled."
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"A function of the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "line": 337,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now she chooses to be brief."
    },
    {
      "line": 338,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To be… spent."
    },
    {
      "line": 339,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I have no words for this.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 341,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt, looking at Luminaire’s fading light, found them."
    },
    {
      "line": 342,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It's called love, Zaron.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 344,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon was silent for a long moment."
    },
    {
      "line": 345,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then love is more terrifying than any fire I have ever known.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 347,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 349,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 6: THE BATTLE - WESTERN FRONT"
    },
    {
      "line": 351,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At dawn, the Red Hand charged to their deaths."
    },
    {
      "line": 353,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael led them, not with a stealthy approach, but with a roaring chant—a death-song from their lost homeland."
    },
    {
      "line": 354,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Forty voices, raised in defiant dirge."
    },
    {
      "line": 355,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tharn, the young Giant, marched with them, his massive frame a beacon."
    },
    {
      "line": 357,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Needle’s western face came alive."
    },
    {
      "line": 358,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Plasma turrets swiveled and fired."
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first five Red Hand were vaporized mid-charge."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tharn took three searing bolts to the chest, his enchanted hide smoking, but he bellowed and kept moving."
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the ground around the western trench line shifted."
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Figures pulled themselves from the earth—Ashen Constructs, fifteen of them, rising like golems of nightmare."
    },
    {
      "line": 364,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lava-cooled shells, limbs of articulated stone, cores of violet light."
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved with a chilling, coordinated purpose, converging on the noise."
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Red Hand fought with the desperate economy of the damned."
    },
    {
      "line": 368,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three soldiers to a construct."
    },
    {
      "line": 369,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One would draw its magma-fist swing, dying instantly as their armor superheated and cooked them alive."
    },
    {
      "line": 370,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The other two would hammer at the joints with picks and hammers, cracking the stone shell."
    },
    {
      "line": 371,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each construct killed cost three or four Red Hand."
    },
    {
      "line": 373,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were losing."
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And by losing, they were winning."
    },
    {
      "line": 375,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every construct, every automated turret, every reptilian guard that committed to the west was one less for the east."
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tharn planted himself at a narrow causeway."
    },
    {
      "line": 378,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three constructs bore down on him."
    },
    {
      "line": 379,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Magma fists slammed into his chest, his legs."
    },
    {
      "line": 380,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hide blackened and cracked."
    },
    {
      "line": 381,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He roared, not in pain, but in defiance, and swung his tree-trunk club, shattering one construct’s leg."
    },
    {
      "line": 383,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Geralt, they are dying too fast,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s voice was a plea in his mind. He was underground, in the searing dark, but he felt it."
    },
    {
      "line": 386,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Can you help him? Just him?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"It will cost.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Do it.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 392,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the bond, across the distance, a thread of Luminaire’s essence stretched."
    },
    {
      "line": 393,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A shimmering, golden harmonic shield flickered around Tharn."
    },
    {
      "line": 394,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The next magma fist struck it and splashed harmlessly away."
    },
    {
      "line": 395,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cost: in the volcanic tunnel, Geralt felt a piece of her presence tear, like a page from a book, and burn to nothing."
    },
    {
      "line": 397,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tharn held."
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Red Hand, behind him, died to the last, until only eight bloodied survivors remained, fighting back-to-back over the bodies of their brothers and sisters."
    },
    {
      "line": 399,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The western approach was a charnel house of shattered stone and broken bodies."
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But sixty percent of the garrison was committed there."
    },
    {
      "line": 402,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The east was open."
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 406,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 7: EASTERN ASSAULT - MIKA'S FRONT"
    },
    {
      "line": 408,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika gave the signal."
    },
    {
      "line": 409,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three hundred Legion soldiers charged the eastern perimeter."
    },
    {
      "line": 411,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only five constructs stood in their way."
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The rest were west, murdering the Red Hand."
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Focus fire! Break them!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 415,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar roared."
    },
    {
      "line": 417,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion swarmed each walking stone, fifteen soldiers to a monster."
    },
    {
      "line": 418,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was brutal, grinding work."
    },
    {
      "line": 419,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hammers and axes chipped at lava-shell."
    },
    {
      "line": 420,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Magma sprayed, melting flesh and metal."
    },
    {
      "line": 421,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldiers fell screaming."
    },
    {
      "line": 422,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the constructs fell too, one by one, shattering into inert rock."
    },
    {
      "line": 424,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cost: four to six men per construct."
    },
    {
      "line": 425,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twenty to thirty souls."
    },
    {
      "line": 426,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But they broke through."
    },
    {
      "line": 428,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They reached the shimmering, multi-layered energy shield that hugged the Needle’s base."
    },
    {
      "line": 429,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It hummed with a deadly power."
    },
    {
      "line": 431,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Kessa",
      "text": "\"Layered! Reinforced!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 433,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika, her face smudged with ash, made the call."
    },
    {
      "line": 434,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then we hold here!"
    },
    {
      "line": 435,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We hit it!"
    },
    {
      "line": 436,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We hit it and we keep hitting it until it breaks!"
    },
    {
      "line": 437,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt needs time!"
    },
    {
      "line": 438,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We BUY it!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 440,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion formed a shield wall and began pounding the energy barrier with everything they had—axes, hammers, kinetic blasts from their few remaining rune-casters."
    },
    {
      "line": 441,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shields flickered, weakened, but held."
    },
    {
      "line": 442,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Plasma turrets on the Needle’s mid-levels targeted them."
    },
    {
      "line": 443,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Men died, crisped to carbon where they stood."
    },
    {
      "line": 445,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"Geralt, the shield harmonics… I can disrupt them,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 447,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"You're already fading.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 449,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"They are dying NOW. Decide.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 451,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He closed his eyes in the oppressive dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 452,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Do it.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 454,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Another piece of her ripped away."
    },
    {
      "line": 455,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Across the battlefield, a resonant chime, felt more than heard, shivered through the air."
    },
    {
      "line": 456,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The layered shields crackled, their perfect harmony disrupted."
    },
    {
      "line": 457,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A section flickered, turned opaque, and developed a spiderweb of cracks."
    },
    {
      "line": 459,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika saw it."
    },
    {
      "line": 460,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"THERE!"
    },
    {
      "line": 461,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "FOCUS ALL FIRE!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 463,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shield section shattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 464,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The eastern approach was breached."
    },
    {
      "line": 465,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cost of the breach was etched in the dead around Mika’s feet, and in the profound dimming of the light in Geralt’s soul."
    },
    {
      "line": 467,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 469,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 8: UNDERGROUND - STRIKE TEAM"
    },
    {
      "line": 471,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The volcanic tunnels were the belly of the beast."
    },
    {
      "line": 473,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Heat beyond endurance."
    },
    {
      "line": 474,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Air that was poison."
    },
    {
      "line": 475,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt led Jorik, Lyra, Skarreth, and Kessa through the glowing, suffocating dark."
    },
    {
      "line": 476,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their armor blistered."
    },
    {
      "line": 477,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wet rags over their faces provided scant relief."
    },
    {
      "line": 479,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tunnels fought back."
    },
    {
      "line": 480,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A section of ceiling collapsed, burying Kessa before she could scream."
    },
    {
      "line": 481,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her technomancer’s skills died with her."
    },
    {
      "line": 482,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A hundred yards on, the floor beneath Skarreth gave way, plunging the engineer into a pocket of glowing magma."
    },
    {
      "line": 483,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His death was silent, swift, and horrible."
    },
    {
      "line": 485,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Toxic fumes wafted from vents."
    },
    {
      "line": 486,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra pushed antidote herbs under their noses, her own movements sluggish."
    },
    {
      "line": 487,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Can't… pass out…\""
    },
    {
      "line": 489,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two kilometers of hell."
    },
    {
      "line": 490,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An hour that stretched into eternity."
    },
    {
      "line": 491,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They emerged, finally, into a service corridor within the Needle’s foundation."
    },
    {
      "line": 492,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From five, they were three: Geralt, Jorik, Lyra."
    },
    {
      "line": 494,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved upward, through maintenance shafts humming with alien energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 495,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The defenses were lighter here—the garrison was committed outside."
    },
    {
      "line": 497,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But not absent."
    },
    {
      "line": 499,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Six figures stood guard at an intersection."
    },
    {
      "line": 500,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They wore tattered remnants of rebel armor, but their eyes were vacant, their movements perfectly synchronized."
    },
    {
      "line": 501,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corrupted Igigi."
    },
    {
      "line": 502,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rebels who had fought the Queen, captured, and reprogrammed."
    },
    {
      "line": 504,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik froze, nocking an arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 505,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"I know them,\" he breathed."
    },
    {
      "line": 506,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The two on the left."
    },
    {
      "line": 507,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fought beside them at the Siege of Verdant Gorge."
    },
    {
      "line": 508,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They chose freedom.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 510,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now they were hollow weapons."
    },
    {
      "line": 512,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There was no time for mercy."
    },
    {
      "line": 513,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They showed none."
    },
    {
      "line": 514,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik’s first arrow took one through the throat."
    },
    {
      "line": 515,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His hand shook as he fired the second."
    },
    {
      "line": 516,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt moved like a shadow, his blade a silver flash, cutting them down with efficient, soul-crushing strokes."
    },
    {
      "line": 517,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each kill felt like murder."
    },
    {
      "line": 518,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each was a comrade lost twice over."
    },
    {
      "line": 520,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They left the six bodies behind, a small, tragic cairn in the sterile hallway, and pressed on toward the core, their victory tasting of ashes."
    },
    {
      "line": 522,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 524,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 9: THE CORE - NODE GAMMA RETURNS"
    },
    {
      "line": 526,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The interior defied physics."
    },
    {
      "line": 527,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Staircases curved in non-Euclidean angles."
    },
    {
      "line": 528,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gravity seemed to pull in different directions."
    },
    {
      "line": 529,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire guided them, her voice their only compass."
    },
    {
      "line": 530,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The core is… down."
    },
    {
      "line": 531,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And inward."
    },
    {
      "line": 532,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The architecture is conscious deception.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 534,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They never reached the core chamber."
    },
    {
      "line": 536,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma attacked them in a transit corridor."
    },
    {
      "line": 538,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It had evolved."
    },
    {
      "line": 539,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No longer a pulsing orb of malevolent data, it was now semi-corporeal, a shifting cloud of violet static and fragmented geometry."
    },
    {
      "line": 540,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It had learned from its defeat in the Forest."
    },
    {
      "line": 542,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It phased through a solid wall behind them and struck Lyra with a lance of coherent corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 543,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She cried out, falling, a black, smoking wound on her shoulder."
    },
    {
      "line": 545,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik fired."
    },
    {
      "line": 546,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His arrow passed through its insubstantial form."
    },
    {
      "line": 547,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s sword swing met only air."
    },
    {
      "line": 549,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"It has adapted!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 550,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire cried. \"It denies physical engagement!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 552,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Panic, separate and paralyzing, erupted in the tripartite mind:"
    },
    {
      "line": 554,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt: Lyra’s down!"
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Protect her!"
    },
    {
      "line": 556,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Find cover!"
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron: It mocks us!"
    },
    {
      "line": 558,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Burn this entire corridor!"
    },
    {
      "line": 559,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Melt the walls!"
    },
    {
      "line": 560,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire: Phase-shift is frequency-based—analysis requires—"
    },
    {
      "line": 562,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The discord was fatal."
    },
    {
      "line": 563,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Node Gamma solidified a single limb—a claw of hard light—and raked it toward Geralt’s chest."
    },
    {
      "line": 564,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He barely twisted away, the energy scoring deep grooves in his breastplate."
    },
    {
      "line": 566,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"TOGETHER! NOW!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 567,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt screamed, the command a fusion of his will, Zaron’s rage, and Luminaire’s desperation."
    },
    {
      "line": 569,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The three consciousnesses slammed into alignment."
    },
    {
      "line": 570,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not harmony, but a single, focused purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 572,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Understanding flashed between them."
    },
    {
      "line": 573,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Phase-shift = dimensional frequency modulation."
    },
    {
      "line": 574,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire provided the counter-frequency."
    },
    {
      "line": 575,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron provided the immense power to broadcast it."
    },
    {
      "line": 576,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt aimed."
    },
    {
      "line": 578,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s armor erupted in pure, solid gold light—the true Vrill resonance, the energy of creation itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 579,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The golden wave hit Node Gamma."
    },
    {
      "line": 581,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It screamed—a digital shriek of outrage and pain—and was forced into solidity for one single, vulnerable second."
    },
    {
      "line": 583,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt was already moving."
    },
    {
      "line": 584,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His sword, blazing with the same gold light, pierced its core."
    },
    {
      "line": 586,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Node exploded not in light, but in a shower of dying data-streams and fragmented whispers."
    },
    {
      "line": 587,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But a piece of it—a shard of its intelligence—shot away, fleeing through the Needle’s systems."
    },
    {
      "line": 589,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Next time,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 590,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "its fading voice hissed in their minds, a promise and a threat. \"Next time I'll be ready for that too.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 592,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It had escaped."
    },
    {
      "line": 593,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wounded, but alive."
    },
    {
      "line": 594,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Learning."
    },
    {
      "line": 596,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 598,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 10: RECONFIGURATION"
    },
    {
      "line": 600,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Core Chamber was a cathedral of madness."
    },
    {
      "line": 601,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Larger than the Forest’s, holographic interfaces displaying not just the Plains, but two other regions—a frozen tundra and a churning ocean—their corruption levels spiking."
    },
    {
      "line": 602,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was a hub."
    },
    {
      "line": 604,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Luminaire",
      "text": "\"The protocols are interwoven,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 606,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s hands moved over the alien console, guided by her consciousness."
    },
    {
      "line": 607,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kessa would have been invaluable here."
    },
    {
      "line": 608,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 609,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik guarded the door, an arrow nocked, listening to the distant sounds of battle."
    },
    {
      "line": 610,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra leaned against a wall, pale, binding her wound."
    },
    {
      "line": 612,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The strain was immense."
    },
    {
      "line": 613,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blood trickled from Geralt’s nose."
    },
    {
      "line": 614,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His vision tunneled."
    },
    {
      "line": 615,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hosting two consciousnesses actively rewriting reality was tearing him apart."
    },
    {
      "line": 616,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron held his body together, muscle and bone, a biological anchor."
    },
    {
      "line": 617,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire burned."
    },
    {
      "line": 619,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt it."
    },
    {
      "line": 620,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "With each line of corrupt code she purified, with each defensive protocol she inverted from destruction to preservation, a piece of her essence was not just used, but consumed."
    },
    {
      "line": 621,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was translating her soul into salvation, word by dying word."
    },
    {
      "line": 623,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Violet light turned to gold."
    },
    {
      "line": 624,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The broadcast of corruption stopped."
    },
    {
      "line": 625,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A new, clean pulse began—a wave of purification that would, over centuries, heal the 30% of the Plains not yet irrevocably scarred."
    },
    {
      "line": 627,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Needle was theirs."
    },
    {
      "line": 629,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s presence in his mind dimmed to a faint, guttering candle."
    },
    {
      "line": 630,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She had burned nearly half of what remained to do this."
    },
    {
      "line": 632,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 634,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 11: AFTERMATH"
    },
    {
      "line": 636,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cost was tallied in the cold language of loss."
    },
    {
      "line": 638,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Western Front: The Red Hand. 40 -> 8 survivors."
    },
    {
      "line": 639,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael lived, missing an arm."
    },
    {
      "line": 640,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tharn lived, but the magma burns and nerve damage had left him paralyzed from the neck down."
    },
    {
      "line": 641,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His eyes, full of fierce spirit, tracked them from a body that would never move again."
    },
    {
      "line": 642,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Eastern Front: 300 -> 247."
    },
    {
      "line": 643,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fifty-three casualties breaching the line."
    },
    {
      "line": 644,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Another twelve holding the breach."
    },
    {
      "line": 645,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Strike Team: Kessa, dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 646,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Skarreth, dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 647,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra, severely wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 648,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Environmental: Ten more lost to the treacherous ground."
    },
    {
      "line": 650,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Total Campaign Casualties (Plains Needle): 109 Killed. 78 Wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 651,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion’s effective force was now under 300 weary, broken souls."
    },
    {
      "line": 653,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Plains themselves were a partial victory."
    },
    {
      "line": 654,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thirty percent might heal."
    },
    {
      "line": 655,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Seventy percent was a permanent, smoking scar on the world."
    },
    {
      "line": 657,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And Luminaire…"
    },
    {
      "line": 659,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She manifested one last time as the Legion gathered its dead and prepared to march."
    },
    {
      "line": 660,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her form was barely visible, a heat-haze mirage of a woman made of light, flickering like a faulty hologram."
    },
    {
      "line": 662,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"One more Needle,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 663,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "her voice chimed, a faint, beautiful echo. \"The Hub. The source. I have… perhaps one more reconfiguration in me. Maybe two. Then I will be gone. Mostly.\" She paused, and in her fading light, there was a new, cunning glimmer. \"But I have learned to hide fragments. To preserve pieces of my knowledge, my purpose… in places where they might be found. Later. By others. It is… a hope.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 665,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was seeding the future."
    },
    {
      "line": 666,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For the 3,000-year gap."
    },
    {
      "line": 667,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For the five who would come later."
    },
    {
      "line": 669,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s final map entry was not drawn that night."
    },
    {
      "line": 670,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was drawn the next morning, her hand steady but her eyes red-rimmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 672,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "line": 673,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "[Detailed sketch of Plains Needle + battlefield]"
    },
    {
      "line": 675,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Day 9 - The Burning Tower"
    },
    {
      "line": 677,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "KIA: 109 names I'll carve into memory"
    },
    {
      "line": 678,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "- Red Hand: 32 (80% casualties)"
    },
    {
      "line": 679,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "- Eastern assault: 65"
    },
    {
      "line": 680,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "- Strike team: 2"
    },
    {
      "line": 681,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "- Environmental: 10"
    },
    {
      "line": 683,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "WIA: 78 (many won't fight again)"
    },
    {
      "line": 685,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tharn: Paralyzed permanently"
    },
    {
      "line": 686,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire: Fragmenting visibly"
    },
    {
      "line": 688,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Plains saved: 30% (estimated)"
    },
    {
      "line": 689,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Plains lost: 70% (permanent scars)"
    },
    {
      "line": 691,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mathematics are worse."
    },
    {
      "line": 692,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We're dying faster than we're saving."
    },
    {
      "line": 694,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But if we stop..."
    },
    {
      "line": 695,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone dies."
    },
    {
      "line": 696,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just slower."
    },
    {
      "line": 698,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One more Needle confirmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 699,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Hub."
    },
    {
      "line": 700,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mountain fortress."
    },
    {
      "line": 701,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Most defended."
    },
    {
      "line": 702,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Final target."
    },
    {
      "line": 704,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We're going to lose more."
    },
    {
      "line": 705,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe everyone."
    },
    {
      "line": 707,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But we're going anyway."
    },
    {
      "line": 709,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Because that's what we do."
    },
    {
      "line": 710,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We see impossible odds."
    },
    {
      "line": 711,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And we march toward them singing.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 712,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "line": 714,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The eight survivors of the Red Hand chose to stay."
    },
    {
      "line": 715,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael, one-armed, took the Needle access crystal Geralt offered."
    },
    {
      "line": 716,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We'll guard this place."
    },
    {
      "line": 717,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Make sure the healing takes."
    },
    {
      "line": 718,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Call it… penance.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 720,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A second Ranger group was born in the ashes of sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "line": 722,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three days of desperate, precious rest."
    },
    {
      "line": 723,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, the remnants of the Legion of the Sun turned their faces to the distant, formidable mountains."
    },
    {
      "line": 724,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To the Hub."
    },
    {
      "line": 726,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They marched away from the two reconfigured Needles, from the two groups of guardians they had created, from the fields of their dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 728,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s light was a faint, persistent ember in Geralt’s mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 729,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fading with every step."
    },
    {
      "line": 730,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Still present."
    },
    {
      "line": 731,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Still choosing to help."
    },
    {
      "line": 733,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Still learning, through her own sacrifice, what it meant to love something enough to die for it."
    },
    {
      "line": 735,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "End of chapter 41"
    },
    {
      "line": 737,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "--"
    }
  ]
}